Cell["The six attachment labelings with a hidden region", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"91af6f47-0b11-4da2-b833-4d0c72c33749"],

Cell["\<\
The following are precisely the six rows for which the composite central-soft \
limit has a certified HR. In each caption the attachment vector lists the \
external-particle labels carried by internal vertices 1,...,5, in that order. \
Every panel uses the same physical orientation: p2 and p1 enter from the \
left, while p3, p4 and p5 leave on the right in decreasing rapidity order. \
Internal vertex labels are fixed. In every panel the Schwinger parameters are \
x0:(1,3), x1:(1,5), x2:(2,3), x3:(2,5), x4:(3,4), x5:(4,5); only the \
external-particle attachments change.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6a0f0ac3-7045-424f-a9bd-da21d0d0d656"],

