Cell["\<\
The composite result is unchanged between the two transverse sign charts \
sigma=+1 and sigma=-1. It is also unchanged for (a,b)=(1,2),(1,3),(2,3), \
covering approach-rate ratios a/b=1/2,1/3,2/3.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"46332a5b-7c1d-4513-9a9f-f103622c00d2"],

