   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}},
   GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{1.1}}, "Rows" -> {{0.65}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"79c02fcb-541c-49d2-8722-4bfe02f6386b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[ImaginaryI]", "CS", "scalar"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["delta", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"4", " ", "D"}], "-", "20"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["delta", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       RowBox[{"8", " ", "epsilon"}]}], "-", "4"}]]}],
   TraditionalForm],
  TraditionalForm,
  Editable->True]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"671e096c-3358-4f7c-bac7-\
7cdae628fdf9"],

Cell["\<\
The two representations therefore agree for the dimensionless integral with \
s12 factored out. Restoring the overall engineering-dimension factor \
s12^(D-6) is a separate conversion and must not be used to redefine the \
infrared region vector.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5d072474-cddc-496d-9633-1f0ab1d4aa90"],

Cell["7. Negative controls and interpretation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c42855bd-40a9-4a77-926b-66860e0c1bf8"],

Cell["\<\
All twelve one-loop pentagon labelings fail already at the recursive \
mixed-derivative pinch preselection for each of the three tested rates. \
Generic MRK gives no certified HR for any labeling of the two-loop seed: six \
labelings produce staged near-misses, but the lower-facet audit rejects them. \
The exact central-soft corrections change the occupied layers and turn one of \
the three staged presentations into a full facet precisely when p4 is \
attached to a four-valent seed vertex.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bd2f5ee3-2303-444b-9e69-9c69001d192f"],

Cell["\<\
This establishes that the earlier blanket statement 'there is no HR in \
five-point MRK' is not correct once the central-soft composite limit is \
included. What is established here is narrower: one specific two-loop seed \
family and all its inequivalent external labelings. A topology scan of its \
vertex-split descendants is the natural next step.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e8958fb4-c78c-4073-a525-ff02f4f3eb2e"],

Cell["8. Reproduction", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4113f706-aa4d-4a92-9773-422a1e6f36c1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", "=", 
   RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", "=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"FileExistsQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", 
         ",", "\"\<HRF_FivePointMRKExploratory.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}],
      ",", "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", 
     RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", "\"\<examples\>\"", 
        ",", "\"\<five_point_mrk_central_soft\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
   ";", 
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKRepoDirectory", "=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"FileExistsQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", "\"\<HiddenRegionFinder.wl\>\""}], 
        "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", 
     RowBox[{"DirectoryName", "[", 
      RowBox[{"DirectoryName", "[", "$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", "]"}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKLibraryOnly", "=", "True"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"Get", "[", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", 
      ",", "\"\<HRF_FivePointMRKExploratory.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"FivePointMRKSummary", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Get", "[", 
    RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", ",", "\"\<certified_summary.wl\>\""}], 
      "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",ExpressionUUID->"08d1beea-c67d-4ce5-9605-055fbfe11181"],

Cell["\<\
Run one targeted certificate with the command below in a terminal from this \
directory. The last arguments are order index, chart, a, b, topology.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"198b832a-07cb-40ad-9df6-48f7333f32ba"],

Cell["\<\
wolframscript -file HRF_FivePointMRKTargetedRun.wl 2 exact-soft-plus 1 2 seed\
\
\>", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"9437cf26-9aaa-43a4-9310-14c00f41b2e1"],

Cell["\<\
wolframscript -file HRF_RunFivePointMRKAllLabelFullLayerAudit.wl 1 2 plus\
\>", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"7b781bfc-9c06-4beb-8165-37cd270c0ef0"],

Cell["Rebuild the compact summary and this notebook with:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8228f0c1-3b06-4589-af0f-12c775c55499"],

Cell["\<\
wolframscript -file HRF_FivePointMRKBuildSummary.wl
wolframscript -file rebuild_five_point_mrk_notebook.wl\
\>", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"ed86beb5-915b-4c92-91a9-d08b35546246"]
},
